Z||000005||Phil||04-21-2000||08:12 PM||||Used to race them many moons ago (61). was clocked at 87mph.  Single MC6 5.9 cu in  3 carbs twin plugs running methanol and caster. Not bad considering that we had no transmissions. ||||reg||1
